    {
      "name": "02 · 交易",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "挂卖单 10 手（独立价位）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "orders"
              ]
            },
            "description": "下单。\n\n- `side`: `buy`/`bid` 或 `sell`/`ask`\n- `order_type`: 引擎只支持 `gtc` / `ioc` / `fok_budget`，其余类型返回 `MatchingUnsupportedCommand`（冻结资金会原样退回）\n- `reserve_price`: 买单的冻结价，缺省等于 `price`；不得低于委托价\n\n`order_id` 全局唯一，重复会被拒。本用例由脚本自动生成。",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"uid\": {{sellerUid}},\n  \"order_id\": {{askOrderId}},\n  \"symbol\": {{symbol}},\n  \"price\": {{px}},\n  \"size\": 10,\n  \"side\": \"sell\",\n  \"order_type\": \"gtc\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "// order_id 全局唯一，重复下单会被拒（MatchingDuplicateOrderId）",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('askOrderId', Date.now() % 1000000000);",
                  "// 每次运行挑一个独立价位，使断言不受簿中既有挂单干扰",
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('px', 1000 + (Date.now() % 5000));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('命令被受理', function () {",
                  "    const allowed = [];",
                  "    if (!j.accepted && allowed.indexOf(j.result_code) < 0) {",
                  "        pm.expect.fail('result_code = ' + j.result_code);",
                  "    }",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('未成交，全部挂入簿中', () => pm.expect(j.events.length).to.eql(0));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "查盘口（本次价位应出现）",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/depth?symbol={{symbol}}&limit=10",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "depth"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "symbol",
                  "value": "{{symbol}}"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "10"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": ""
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "const px = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('px'));",
                  "const lvl = j.asks.find(a => a.price === px);",
                  "pm.test('本次挂单的价位出现在盘口', () => pm.expect(lvl).to.not.be.undefined);",
                  "pm.test('该档数量为 10', () => pm.expect(lvl.size).to.eql(10));",
                  "console.log('本次价位 ' + px + ' -> ' + JSON.stringify(lvl));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "买单吃掉 3 手（部分成交）",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "orders"
              ]
            },
            "description": "买 3 手，返回 `Trade` 事件。`events` 里每条含成交量、成交价、对手单号与对手 uid。\n\n**注意价格优先**：买单从最优（最低）卖价开始吃，成交价必然不高于委托价。若簿中存在比本次价位更便宜的卖单，会先被吃掉，因此成交对手不一定是上一步挂的那张。断言据此只校验成交总量与价格上界。",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"uid\": {{buyerUid}},\n  \"order_id\": {{bidOrderId}},\n  \"symbol\": {{symbol}},\n  \"price\": {{px}},\n  \"size\": 3,\n  \"side\": \"buy\",\n  \"order_type\": \"gtc\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.collectionVariables.set('bidOrderId', (Date.now() % 1000000000) + 1);"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('命令被受理', function () {",
                  "    const allowed = [];",
                  "    if (!j.accepted && allowed.indexOf(j.result_code) < 0) {",
                  "        pm.expect.fail('result_code = ' + j.result_code);",
                  "    }",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('产生成交事件，成交量合计 3 手', function () {",
                  "    const px = Number(pm.collectionVariables.get('px'));",
                  "    const trades = j.events.filter(e => e.kind === 'Trade');",
                  "    pm.expect(trades.length).to.be.above(0);",
                  "    const filled = trades.reduce((n, t) => n + t.size, 0);",
                  "    pm.expect(filled).to.eql(3);",
                  "    // 价格优先：买单从最优（最低）卖价开始吃，成交价必然 <= 委托价。",
                  "    // 簿中若存在比本次价位更便宜的卖单，会先被吃掉 —— 这是正确行为。",
                  "    trades.forEach(t => pm.expect(t.price).to.be.at.most(px));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "减量 2 手",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/{{askOrderId}}/reduce",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "orders",
                "{{askOrderId}}",
                "reduce"
              ]
            },
            "description": "减少挂单的剩余数量，按实际减少量退还冻结资金（`Reduce` 事件）。\n\n部分减量时订单**保留原有排队位次**——时间优先不会因减量而丢失。\n减到 0 等同于撤单。",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"uid\": {{sellerUid}},\n  \"symbol\": {{symbol}},\n  \"size\": 2\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('命令被受理', function () {",
                  "    const allowed = [];",
                  "    if (!j.accepted && allowed.indexOf(j.result_code) < 0) {",
                  "        pm.expect.fail('result_code = ' + j.result_code);",
                  "    }",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "撤单（退回剩余）",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/orders/{{askOrderId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "orders",
                "{{askOrderId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "撤销挂单，未成交部分的冻结资金原样退回（`Reject` 事件）。\n\n`uid` 与订单实际所有者不符时返回 `MatchingUnknownOrderId`——刻意不区分「不存在」与「无权限」，避免泄露订单是否存在。",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"uid\": {{sellerUid}},\n  \"symbol\": {{symbol}}\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('HTTP 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('命令被受理', function () {",
                  "    const allowed = [];",
                  "    if (!j.accepted && allowed.indexOf(j.result_code) < 0) {",
                  "        pm.expect.fail('result_code = ' + j.result_code);",
                  "    }",
                  "});",
                  "pm.test('产生退款事件', function () {",
                  "    const rej = j.events.filter(e => e.kind === 'Reject');",
                  "    pm.expect(rej.length).to.be.above(0);",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
