            "description": "引擎只支持 gtc / ioc / fok_budget。此处 `iceberg` 会在服务层被拒（400）。\n\n注：若绕过服务层直接投给引擎，会返回 `MatchingUnsupportedCommand`，且 R1 冻结的资金由撮合层补发的 Reject 事件退回，不会被永久锁死。",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"uid\": {{buyerUid}},\n  \"order_id\": 999000001,\n  \"symbol\": {{symbol}},\n  \"price\": 100,\n  \"size\": 1,\n  \"side\": \"buy\",\n  \"order_type\": \"iceberg\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
